Subject: [PATCH v5] /proc/sysrq-trigger: accept multiple keys at once
Date:   Tue, 14 Nov 2023 13:41:52 +0100
Message-ID: <20231114124152.97010-1-tomas.mudrunka@gmail.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.42.1
